     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\">Hi,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\">I got the below error message when trying to install INLA (stable or testing) on R 3.6.0.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\"><br></div><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11.9px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(27,31,34);background-color:rgb(244,246,249)\"><span>Error in slibs[are_shared] : invalid subscript type &#39;list&#39;</span></p><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\">I solved it by adding </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\"><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(27,31,34)\"><span>StagedInstall: no</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(27,31,34)\"><span><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(27,31,34)\">into the DESCRIPTION file (following [1] and [2]).</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(27,31,34)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(27,31,34)\">gg</p></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\">[1]<a href=\"https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/issues/46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/issues/46&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441948795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2mC3II7TALJ9Q1gPErSkIg\">https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/issues/46</a></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace\">[2]<a href=\"https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/pull/47/commits/c718d92356462334c615a40386dfab688ad1db07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/pull/47/commits/c718d92356462334c615a40386dfab688ad1db07&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441948795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34nGQmP0qnKtsUGVY4cvx5\">https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/pull/47/commits/c718d92356462334c615a40386dfab688ad1db07</a></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
