    [
     3,
     "\r<br>On Sun, 2019-05-19 at 16:52 +0200, Gregor Gorjanc wrote:\r<br>&gt; Hi,\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; I got the below error message when trying to install INLA (stable or\r<br>&gt; testing) on R 3.6.0.\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; Error in slibs[are_shared] : invalid subscript type &#39;list&#39;\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; I solved it by adding \r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; StagedInstall: no\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; into the DESCRIPTION file (following [1] and [2]).\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; gg\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; [1]<a href=\"https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/issues/46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/issues/46&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441948795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2mC3II7TALJ9Q1gPErSkIg\">https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/issues/46</a>\r<br>&gt; [2]\r<br>&gt; <a href=\"https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/pull/47/commits/c718d92356462334c615a40386dfab688ad1db07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/pull/47/commits/c718d92356462334c615a40386dfab688ad1db07&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441948795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34nGQmP0qnKtsUGVY4cvx5\">https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/pull/47/commits/c718d92356462334c615a40386dfab688ad1db07</a>\r<br>"
